 survive the Tavshanzade Island and overcome the your Ghoul?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420000/extras/d9473475b7900032d5415cb68f4516c7.poster.avif?t=1715681432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420000/extras/d9473475b7900032d5415cb68f4516c7.webm?t=1715681432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420000/extras/d9473475b7900032d5415cb68f4516c7.mp4?t=1715681432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
